+
+When Evan repairs a corrupted winner, Vera must treat `results/{pair}/strategy_returns_*.csv` as the source of truth for every winner-specific chart. Do not reconstruct positions from tournament codes inside chart scripts; that fork preserved the stale `S2_yoy` UMCSENT winner even after `winner_summary.json` was fixed. Also refresh derivative CP CSVs (`subperiod_sharpe.csv`, rolling strategy Sharpe) from the canonical stream before charting them.
