+| `subperiod_sharpe` | Stale subperiod CSV from pre-refresh winner | Corrected subperiod CSV; full OOS row Sharpe `1.158553`, annual return `7.9494%`, max drawdown `-0.7007%` | `strategy_returns_20260420.csv` |
